<title>TAIWAN: Winbond to raise '97 pre-tax forecast.</title>
<headline>Winbond to raise '97 pre-tax forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Winbond Electronics Corp, one of the island's leading chipmakers, said on Monday it had decided to raise its 1997 pre-tax profit forecast to T$2.43 billion from an original prediction of T$550 million.</p>
</text>
